# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MedMesh frontend configuration
#
# Copy to `.env` for local development, or set as EAS secrets for a build.
# Nothing here is committed with a real value.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Where the Python API lives. Leave unset for the default resolution:
# web uses same-origin (the preview server proxies /api), native derives the
# host from the Metro bundler URI, Android emulator falls back to 10.0.2.2.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.medmesh.example.in

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google Maps — web
#
# The JavaScript API key, restricted by HTTP referrer to the origins you serve
# the web build from. This key is visible in the browser, so a referrer
# restriction is the only thing standing between it and abuse. Do not reuse the
# Android or iOS key here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Directions API key. Falls back to the key above if unset. When neither is set
# the app draws a schematic corridor and labels it as an estimate, and the crew
# app still hands off to the device's own navigation app.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_DIRECTIONS_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google Maps — native (Android/iOS)
#
# These are consumed by app.config.ts at prebuild time, not by the JS bundle.
# The Android key must be restricted by package name (in.medmesh.app) and the
# SHA-1 of the signing certificate; the iOS key by bundle identifier. A key
# without those restrictions can be lifted from the APK and billed to you.
#
# Obtain the signing SHA-1 with:
#   eas credentials -p android
# or, for a local debug build:
#   keytool -list -v -keystore ~/.android/debug.keystore -alias androiddebugkey \
#     -storepass android -keypass android
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MEDMESH_GOOGLE_MAPS_ANDROID_KEY=
# MEDMESH_GOOGLE_MAPS_IOS_KEY=
